Features Offered – AI-Powered Customer Churn Prediction & Retention System

Core AI Features
-Customer Churn Prediction – Predicts the probability of a customer leaving the service.
-Customer Segmentation – Groups customers into segments (Loyal, At-Risk, Dormant, High-Value, etc.) for targeted strategies.
-Customer Lifetime Value (CLV) Prediction – Estimates the future value of each customer to help prioritize retention efforts.
-Explainable AI (XAI) – Explains the key factors contributing to a customer's churn prediction using feature importance.
-Churn Reason Classification – Identifies the most likely reasons for customer churn.
-Customer Analytics
-Customer Health Score – Provides an overall score based on engagement, complaints, activity, and churn risk.
-Customer Engagement Score – Measures customer activity using metrics like login frequency, purchases, and service usage.
-Sentiment Analysis – Analyzes customer reviews, feedback, or support tickets to determine customer sentiment.
-Complaint Severity Detection – Classifies customer complaints based on urgency and impact.
Intelligent Decision Support
-Personalized Retention Recommendation Engine – Suggests the best retention strategies (discounts, offers, support, etc.) for each at-risk customer.
-Feature Importance Analysis – Identifies the most influential factors affecting churn.

Monitoring & Automation
-Real-Time Churn Risk Monitoring – Continuously updates churn risk based on customer activity.
-Automated Alerts & Notifications – Sends alerts when customers reach high churn risk thresholds.
-Email/Notification Automation – Generates personalized retention emails or promotional offers for at-risk customers.
-Customer Risk Ranking – Prioritizes customers based on churn probability and business value.

Visualization & Reporting
--Interactive Dashboard – Displays churn rates, customer segments, health scores, business metrics, and retention recommendations in a single interface.
--Model Performance Comparison – Compares multiple machine learning models using Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-Score, and ROC-AUC.
